    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Camera calibration data is present only if you specified the [`isCameraCalibrationDataDeliveryEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/iscameracalibrationdatadeliveryenabled.md) and [`isDualCameraDualPhotoDeliveryEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isdualcameradualphotodeliveryenabled.md) settings when requesting capture.",
      "ko": "카메라 보정 데이터는 캡처를 요청할 때 [`isCameraCalibrationDataDeliveryEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/iscameracalibrationdatadeliveryenabled.md) 및 [`isDualCameraDualPhotoDeliveryEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isdualcameradualphotodeliveryenabled.md) 설정을 지정한 경우에만 존재합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "697e26f76e9a6457d5e5c089a3c70474a032e975a6550e5010776748aedd64a6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "For camera calibration data in a capture that includes depth data, see the [`AVDepthData`](avdepthdata.md) [`cameraCalibrationData`](avdepthdata/cameracalibrationdata.md) property.",
      "ko": "깊이 데이터가 포함된 캡처에서 카메라 보정 데이터는 [`AVDepthData`](avdepthdata.md) [`cameraCalibrationData`](avdepthdata/cameracalibrationdata.md) 속성을 참조하세요.",
      "sourceHash": "11eeb20b111783d54f01d5d7d7d7c842cbf998bf89bbb697d58021186e1cb50f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
